      "code": "dwarfstring_append(&joind.js_linkstring, link_string_in);",
      "role": "intermediate",
      "note": "link_string_in is \"\" (empty). dwarfstring_append with strlen=0 is a no-op, so js_linkstring.s_data remains pointing to the 1-byte global \"\" literal initialized by dwarfstring_constructor."
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
