      "code": "g->s_data = \"\";",
      "role": "root_cause",
      "note": "dwarfstring_constructor sets s_data to point to a 1-byte global string literal \"\". When the append of an empty link_string_in is a no-op, s_data stays pointing to this 1-byte buffer. is_full_path then reads path[1] unconditionally, exceeding the buffer."
    },
